imb level packs. Choose from a variety of unlockable hamsters to play with.\n\nDevelopment Plans: This game is currently in its public Beta stage. There is only one \"Living Room\" play environment, but a Bakery, Casino, Lobby and more are in development. ", "short_description": "Solve challenging tube puzzles and build the perfect route for your hamster in Tube Be Continued! \n\nGuide your hamster through the tube board and solve mini-puzzles along the way. Bake a cake or hit the slots in the Bakery Blitz and Casino Climb level packs. Choose from a variety of unlockable hamsters to play with.\n\nDevelopment Plans: This game is currently in its public Beta stage. There is only one \"Living Room\" play environment, but a Bakery, Casino, Lobby and more are in development. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bluemonttechnology.com/game%20privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bluemont Technology & Research, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://bluemonttechnology.com/contact/", "website_url": "https://bluemonttechnology.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "465571511788948"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "943312466323382"}]}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1646256420, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "943312466323382"}]}, "liveCh